WEBVTT

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:49.400
<i>The relatives I'm staying with have
 a daughter named Konatsuki Mahiru.</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:46.350
All Messages
 From: <b>Konatsuki Mahiru</b>
 Come to the roof

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.640
Thank you for coming.

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:28.310
Did you need something?

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:31.150
Yeah. It'd be hard to ask at home...

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.550
What did you need to talk about?

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.010
Well... it turns out...

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:44.660
No, I can't. I can't bring
 myself to tell you.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:47.670
We've been friends forever.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:49.080
You can tell me anything.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:56.090
I'll try and get ready, 
so give me a second, okay?

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:57.780
Okay.

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:08.600
It turns out...

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:11.110
that I'm pregnant.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:15.060
There's a baby in me.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.550
Since we've been living together for three 
years and doing all kinds of stuff,

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:31.590
not to mention expressing our love in 
that park with the view of the bay...

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:35.000
I guess it's only natural 
that we could have a baby.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.270
Come on, you know better.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:44.520
Our relationship's never been like that.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.390
Is this for real, Mahiru?

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.310
Yeah. I hate to admit it, but...

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.150
I guess this is a case of "truth 
is stranger than fiction."

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.080
You seem like you want 
to ask whose baby it is.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.400
N-No...

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:03.780
I'm more worried about you, Mahiru.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.660
Thank you. I'm doing okay for now.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.910
But you need to hear this.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.920
About who the father is. Well...

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.160
Mahiru? Mahiru!

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.780
Where are we?

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.310
These look like ruins...

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.830
You seem weirdly calm.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.160
Do I?

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:17.260
Compared to my pregnancy, 
this isn't that weird.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:20.580
In any case, we need to 
find a way out of here.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.700
I'm worried about your condition.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:30.130
Listen, Itsuki, about before...

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:30.950
What do you mean?

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.960
About who the baby's father is.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:35.210
It's okay, you don't have to tell me.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.250
Look, just listen!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.760
The person... The person 
I conceived this baby with...

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:42.380
There...

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.010
isn't one.

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:47.610
I haven't done...

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:50.000
I mean, I don't have to spell it out, do I?!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.810
How could that possibly be?

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:57.810
I noticed something was different 
with my body about a week ago.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:03.070
I looked it up online, and they seemed 
to be symptoms of pregnancy...

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.820
Pregnancy Early Symptoms

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:08.220
I took home pregnancy tests a few times, 
and every time, it was positive.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.780
I didn't know what to do...

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.500
Have you gone to a doctor?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.750
Not yet. I'm too scared.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.680
I haven't told anyone other than you, either.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.710
Okay.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.140
But I'm glad I did tell you.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:28.430
Getting it off my chest like 
this makes me feel a bit better.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.430
Let's see a doctor once we're out of here.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.250
I'll go with you.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.570
Okay.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:35.520
Thank you.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:38.770
What is it? Mahiru!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.380
I suddenly feel sick...

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:41.850
Is it like... morning sickness?

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:10.890
Mahiru!

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.610
What the hell?

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:43.450
<i>I-If I don't do something... I'm dead!</i>

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.470
Are you okay, Mahiru?!

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:08.540
Y-Yeah. I'm fine.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.350
Huh?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.490
Where in the world are we?

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.100
Maybe inside of a bad dream.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:48.690
What's that mark?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.840
You've got one, too. Right there.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:59.120
I do! And it's the same as yours?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.920
I guess this is what you'd call a pair look?

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:05.360
D-Don't be stupid! 
Now's not the time for jokes!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.130
Are you feeling okay?

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.390
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.710
I actually feel a little better, now.

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:17.890
And my stomach feels warm, 
and kind of fluffy...

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:31.170
Hello there, and welcome to
 the land of magic, Granvania!

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:36.110
Is this some kind of toy with 
an A.I. or a drone installed?

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.870
Could be a fairy.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.800
I'm Mana! Wonderful name, isn't it?

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:44.820
Sniff sniff sniff... Now then, girl, 
you're a virgin, aren't you?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.470
You smell fresh as a bed of daisies!

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:49.920
What a rude toy!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.840
Are these the ones you spoke of, Mana?

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.380
That's right, Nar.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.950
These are our Visitors this time.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.550
Look! They've already got the emblems!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.650
Two Visitors...

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:02.850
How fascinating.

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:06.000
It's dangerous to remain here.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.460
Let me show you the way.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.860
Where are we going?

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.820
To Castle Granvania.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:17.700
I want the two of you to meet our ruler.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.480
My name is Narcisstes.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:23.090
I am a court scholar for 
the Granvania Kingdom.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.100
The Granvania Kingdom?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:29.020
In our world, we refer to your world as "Sola."

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:33.710
Granvania exists in a different 
dimension than your own!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:38.720
And the past Visitors have 
called this world one of magic!

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:43.330
So this world and ours are parallel?

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.100
I've brought them, your majesty.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.110
I'm glad you're here.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:55.610
I am the King of Granvania, Shangri-La.

00:09:56.210 --> 00:10:00.660
I'm sure the two of you are shocked 
by the sudden turn of events,

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.620
but first, I'd like you to hear me out.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.620
What is it?

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:07.110
I'll get straight to the point.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:10.260
Our world is being threatened.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:14.000
That is why I want you both to save it.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.280
Save the world? Us?

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.010
Are you serious?

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.550
You two have been chosen as Visitors.

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:25.710
In this world, every ten years, Visitors with

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:29.020
constellation emblems 
appear from the sky.

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:32.690
You have a special power.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.530
I'd like you to use this power 
and carry out this mission.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:39.520
Or rather, it's absolutely 
necessary you must.

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:43.280
Your power is the only thing 
that can save this world.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:48.900
Are you saying we can't go home 
unless we save this world?

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:51.380
Indeed I am. You're very perceptive.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:55.490
We're just high school students, though!

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:57.510
Saving the world...

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:01.000
and stuff about missions, 
it's all kind of sudden.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:02.800
Mahiru!

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.120
Take her to the doctor.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.310
Of course, Your Majesty.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:08.730
You must be tired as well.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.840
You should rest in your room.

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.590
Where'd Mahiru get taken?

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:15.770
What? Are you nervous without her around?

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.330
What a lech. So lascivious!

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:21.940
I can only imagine what manner of 
perversions you've gotten up to!

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:25.060
"Oh no, we can't! My family 
is home, not like this!"

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:27.830
"Today's just a secret 
between you and me, okay?"

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.900
The two of you canoodling 
under the same roof!

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:32.830
I'm so envious, you Visitervert!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.350
Visitervert?

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.960
It's fine! She's just resting 
in the doctor's office.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:41.160
The doctor said she's simply a bit exhausted.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.360
That's good.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:44.220
We'll continue this talk tomorrow.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.410
I'll bring you some food later.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:50.760
You've got a real beauty taking care of 
you now, so you had better be grateful!

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:52.230
Beauty? Who?

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.600
Don't use me for wank material, okay?

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.110
You beast!

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:01.110
The honored Visitor has finally appeared.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.620
The time has come for me to fulfill my duty.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:13.120
No, no!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:16.130
They're so good, though...

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.810
What is this?!

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.400
You've got a nicer body than expected.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:43.530
It should be fine entrusting you
 with the fate of our world.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:49.540
Oh, don't worry, I won't be 
taking your underwear off.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.910
Oh? Is it just me, or are 
you a little disappointed?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:53.940
Maybe a little.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.150
I'm the court doctor, Reone.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:13:00.170
Itsuki, I want you to take 
a good look at your body.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:06.280
Your body has emblems representing 
all 12 constellations.

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.610
See?

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:14.440
These are the proof that you are a Visitor.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.730
So what are we supposed to do?

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.190
You're willing to do it, then?

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.270
If it's the only way we can 
get back home, we have to.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:25.300
I know Mahiru wants to get back, too.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:29.200
Once you complete your mission, 
the gate of light should appear again.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:34.070
A Visitor's mission is to enter the 
labyrinth and quiet the Impurities.

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.210
Impurities?

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:38.380
The Impurities of the labyrinth 
have turned into monsters,

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.840
making them extremely dangerous.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.880
When you say monsters...

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.700
Plus, at the deepest layer of 
the labyrinth is the Lord Impurity.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:51.060
And unfortunately, it can't be defeated
by residents of this world.

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:54.290
History has proven that out.

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:56.760
And I can really do this?

00:13:57.200 --> 00:14:00.730
You have to retrieve the Star Wards that 
have lost their power from the labyrinth,

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.070
along with offering new ones.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:08.030
That way, the labyrinth will be able 
to contain the Impurities again.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.530
Star Wards?

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.830
You can learn more over here.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:16.530
<b>Check the official website for details!</b>

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:16.140
Make sure to figure it out as you move ahead.

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:19.570
But I'm just a normal human.

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.840
I don't have the power to fight monsters.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.420
That's not quite right. You're a Visitor.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:27.210
The hero that will save this world.

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:29.500
Also, you're not alone.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.420
The priestesses of the twelve constellations

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:34.140
will join you to ensure 
your mission is a success.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:39.190
The twelve maidens are chosen at birth 
for their ability to purify Impurities!

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.400
They aid the Visitor,

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:48.360
and using their special power are able to 
create a Star Ward of their own constellation,

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.710
and until it loses its power...

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:56.010
they fulfull their duties as a priestess!

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:13.600
Not only that,

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:17.730
but she's among them.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:24.730
Wha...

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:28.750
Allow me to introduce you 
to the priestess of Virgo.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:29.740
Mahiru?

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.320
I was told the same story.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:36.830
It seems I'm a Visitor who was summoned 
here as the priestess of Virgo.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:41.750
Did your body expel anything 
when that emblem surfaced?

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.300
Yeah, I threw up...

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:48.620
Thinking about it makes me 
feel sick again, in fact.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.250
Those chosen to be priestesses...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.760
Expel any Impurities they're 
born with from their own body.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.870
Depending on the person,

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:59.860
they can sometimes develop symptoms 
similiar to pregnancy, beforehand...

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:01.770
You mean...

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.750
Yes, you should be fine, now.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:07.040
You've already expelled 
the Impurity, after all.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.530
What a relief. I wasn't pregnant after all.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.380
The priestess has one other important task!

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.850
And that is the Love Ritual!

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.030
Love Ritual?

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.460
The 12 priestesses themselves

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.860
cannot stand directly against Impurities!

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:23.730
Instead, they can give 
birth to your children!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:24.540
Children?

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.840
That's right! You and the priestesses will 
be joined to give birth to a Star Child!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:32.360
That's right! Set the course for intercourse!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:33.800
Intercourse...

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:37.060
I'm not gonna let you pretend you don't know!

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.220
I'm talking about relations 
between a man and a woman!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.370
Coitus, copulation, relations, 
a nighttime rendezvous,

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:45.610
physical negotiations, intimacy, 
a tryst, fornication!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:47.670
A carnal embrace! A hookup! A booty call!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:50.440
In other words, sex!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:03.960
Come on! Say it! "We love sex!"

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.960
I mean, who doesn't?

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.510
The Star Children are the only ones

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:12.970
capable of purifying Impurities, 
with the Visitor's help.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:17.870
In other words, you making babies is a crucial
 act that will ensure this world's safety,

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.510
and a proven strategy that 
will dictate all our fates!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.510
It's nothing compared to typical courtships!

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:24.640
This love will save the world!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:30.410
That said... being surrounded by twelve 
beauties, you'll have a literal harem!

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:32.490
Fantastic, right? Bet you're
 already drooling.

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:37.170
Actions speak louder than words.

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:41.080
Let's have you perform the Love Ritual 
here and create the first Star Child.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.080
Right now?!

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:43.570
This is perfect.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:46.050
You can practice with Mahiru.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:48.640
It'll be easier if the first time 
is with someone you know, right?

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:53.920
I'll teach you how to carry 
out the ritual in... detail.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.790
Hang on a second, Dr. Reone!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.020
You want me to... right now... with him?

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:00.600
It's all right. You'll get used to it soon.

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:01.850
I sure hope not!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.190
It only hurts at first, you know...

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:07.180
You'll feel great after a while.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:09.910
"This is amazing! I've never 
felt anything like it!"

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:13.850
Mahiru, this is so you can 
return to your world.

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.070
You need to face reality.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:19.110
Itsuki, this is her first time, so be gentle.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:20.120
Right.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.170
Well, let's begin.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.280
This sure is sudden.

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.760
<i>What kind of ritual is this?</i>

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:47.600
I guess...

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:51.280
We have to do this to get home, don't we?

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:52.540
Seems that way.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:57.900
It is really sudden, though...

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:01.170
I mean, I've thought about this a lot.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:03.080
About the right place... the right person.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.660
I guess so.

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:06.480
That's not it!

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:09.330
I wasn't trying to say I hate 
the idea of being with you, Itsuki!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.210
I mean, I wouldn't mind 
losing my virginity to you...

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:19.250
But... in a situation like this, with 
everyone watching... that's crazy.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.680
And doing it to get pregnant...

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:25.430
The Love Ritual isn't the same 
thing as procreating, you see.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.860
The Star Children arise without 
any discomfort for the priestess,

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:31.330
they just pop forth! Don't worry.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.060
"Pop"?

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.960
A little reluctance is all part of the fun!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:37.160
The trick is to try it out! 
So start trying, right now!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:40.500
Just a little! Just the tip! Please?

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.630
You pervert!

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.160
What are you doing?!

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:47.410
I'm here to look after Itsuki!

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:53.060
All right, off with the fancy underwear!

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:55.750
And let's show him your birthday suit!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:56.570
No!

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:59.890
Come on, Itsuki! Get over here!

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:03.640
Oh, so plump and so smooth, 
perfect for fondling...

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.880
It'd be a waste not to get it on!

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:09.000
Why are you so strong 
when you're just a toy?!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:17.050
What are you doing?!

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.690
Mahiru wants you to stop.

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:30.490
I think your feelings are 
the first priority here.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:32.240
Naturally.

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:35.770
But when I think about 
what's happened so far,

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:38.890
doing as they say is the only 
way we can get home.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.970
You don't have to force it.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:42.980
But...

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.470
To fulfill our mission...

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:51.600
I want you to have my child!

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.310
S-Sorry...

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.880
This is so we can go home.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:30.560
Right?

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.500
Be gentle, okay?

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.000
<b>My Child?!</b>

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:40.460
I Want You to Have My Child

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:39.280
<i>You want to watch?</i>
